          <a href="blog/why-we-invested-in-tempo.html">
            <img src="https://data.decoassets.com/maya/98adf092-7afa-468e-961f-a355c7bf5347/phone-computer-graphic-showing-mobile-phone-lifestyle.jpg" alt="Tempo">
